{
  "info": {
    "name": "Rockfall Prediction API",
    "_postman_id": "rockfall-prediction-api-2026",
    "description": "API test collection for the AI-Based Rockfall Prediction & Alert System.\n\nREAL APIs (working system):\n  - POST /api/analysis/cv  (multipart image + zone_id) on the Spring Boot backend\n  - GET  /api/analysis/risk/{zoneId}\n  - Health checks for CV and ML services\n\nMOCK/FUTURE APIs (standalone mock server at :8001):\n  - telemetry, cv-results, predictions, risk status, incidents, zones, rockfall events\n\nReal backend services:\n  - Spring Boot backend:  http://localhost:8080\n  - CV service:          http://localhost:8000\n  - ML risk engine:      http://127.0.0.1:9000",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "realBackendUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "cvUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "mlUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:9000"
    },
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8001"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "zoneId",
      "value": "SLOPE_A"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Real Backend - Analysis",
      "description": "Endpoints implemented in the real Spring Boot backend (/api/analysis).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Analyze Image (CV + ML)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response contains cvResult', function () {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('cvResult');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.cvResult).to.have.property('crack_detected');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.cvResult).to.have.property('crack_severity');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.cvResult).to.have.property('deformation_mm');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.cvResult).to.have.property('crack_confidence');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response contains riskResult', function () {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('riskResult');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.riskResult).to.have.property('risk_class');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.riskResult).to.have.property('risk_level');",
                  "    pm.expect(json.riskResult).to.have.property('confidence');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{realBackendUrl}}/api/analysis/cv",
              "host": ["{{realBackendUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "analysis", "cv"]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "image",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": []
                },
                {
                  "key": "zone_id",
                  "value": "{{zoneId}}",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Analyze Risk By Zone",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response contains risk fields', function () {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('risk_class');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('risk_level');",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.have.property('confidence');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{realBackendUrl}}/api/analysis/risk/{{zoneId}}",
              "host": ["{{realBackendUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "analysis", "risk", "{{zoneId}}"]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
